_stops": 0, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 7, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "The spec is implemented and the required check passes: `.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/test_create_table_parser.py tests/test_introspect.py tests/test_transform.py` gives 164 passed. The full `tests/` suite also passes (1416 passed, 16 skipped). Nothing is committed.\n\nThe implementer subagent made all the changes:\n- **New `sqlite_utils/create_table_parser.py`** (standard library only) holds the lexer, `Check`, `ColumnComments`, `ParseError`, an embedded list of SQLite keywords, and the five functions the spec names.\n- **In `sqlite_utils/db.py`** it imports those names and adds the two helpers. `create_table_sql` takes the new `_checks` and `_column_comments` parameters. Tables gain `checks`, `column_checks` and `table_checks`. `transform_sql` now keeps CHECK constraints and column comments, renaming columns inside the constraints.\n\nI read the `db.py` diff against the spec and the rename logic in the parser, and found nothing to change. I also ran a quick end-to-end test:\n- A column CHECK, a named table CHECK and the comments on each column all survived a rename. `n > 0` became `num > 0`.\n- Dropping a column that a remaining constraint uses raised `TransformError(\"Cannot drop column 'num': it is used by CHECK constraint 'pos'\")`.\n\nThe subagent made three decisions where the spec left room:\n- **Table names:** in `t.col`, `col` counts as a column reference, so it gets renamed.\n- **`IF NOT EXISTS`:** `CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS` is rejected with a `ParseError`, following the spec's wording. This shouldn't affect real tables, because SQLite doesn't store that clause in the saved table schema.\n- **No linting:** ruff isn't installed in the venv, so lint and format weren't run. One regex line in the parser is longer than 88 characters.", "ttft_ms": 2435, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 353939, "uuid": "0196e3ed-bb90-4c80-90a4-eaf6c852fd28", "ttft_stream_ms": 1842, "time_to_request_ms": 178, "first_content_frame_ms": 1842, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
